    "name": "Prado",
    "instructions": "1. Combine all ingredients in a cocktail shaker.\n2. Dry shake to emulsify the egg whites.\n3. Add ice and shake until chilled.\n4. Double strain into a chilled cocktail glass.\n5. Garnish with a lime wheel, skewered cherry, and a small sprig of mint.",
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
    "description": "The Prado is a sophisticated tequila sour that redefines the classic egg white cocktail. With its base of smooth tequila blanco, vibrant lime juice, and a touch of maraschino liqueur, this drink balances sharp acidity with rich, nutty sweetness. The crowning touch is a velvety foam of egg whites, adding a luxurious texture that makes every sip feel indulgent. Perfect for tequila enthusiasts seeking a refreshing yet complex twist on a timeless classic.",
